{"parse":{"title":"特性/暗影浣熊","pageid":7446,"revid":17911,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E6%9A%97%E5%BD%B1%E6%B5%A3%E7%86%8A&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E6%9A%97%E5%BD%B1%E6%B5%A3%E7%86%8A&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E6%9A%97%E5%BD%B1%E6%B5%A3%E7%86%8A&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>暗影浣熊</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.9A.97.E5.BD.B1.E6.B5.A3.E7.86.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"暗影浣熊\"><b>暗影浣熊</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 喷射触手.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/86/gqsdzfsa2thniog40bk3vjadxwucswt.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%96%B7%E5%B0%84%E8%A7%A6%E6%89%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/86/gqsdzfsa2thniog40bk3vjadxwucswt.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%96%B7%E5%B0%84%E8%A7%A6%E6%89%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/86/gqsdzfsa2thniog40bk3vjadxwucswt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />暗影浣熊\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦行动结束时，若自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内友军小于等于<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>时，召唤2个分身，继承生命值<font color=\"#58cb48\">65%</font>，攻防属性<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>，每场战斗最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">35%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%9A%97%E5%BD%B1%E6%B5%A3%E7%86%8A\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/暗影浣熊\"><img alt=\"暗影浣熊 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c1/662en5vey4owhe13xwzyxnj39dql5zc.png/75px-%E6%9A%97%E5%BD%B1%E6%B5%A3%E7%86%8A_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c1/662en5vey4owhe13xwzyxnj39dql5zc.png/113px-%E6%9A%97%E5%BD%B1%E6%B5%A3%E7%86%8A_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c1/662en5vey4owhe13xwzyxnj39dql5zc.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164210\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.067 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 251/1000000\n